/phenomenological-collapse/</guid><description/></item><item><title>The neutron as an alternative explanation for the trans-GZK cosmic rays</title><link>https://unanue.mx/research/neutron-gzk/</link><pubDate>Sat, 10 Nov 2007 00:00:00 -0600</pubDate><guid>https://unanue.mx/research/neutron-gzk/</guid><description/></item></channel></rss>